  "Genres": "Shooter",
  "Name": "Hypership Out of Control!",
  "Overview": "Your space-brakes are out, the accelerator is stuck, and you can't stop. Hypership Out of Control is a scrolling shooter for up to four players. The titular Hypership continually accelerates forward, and the player must shoot and avoid obstacles while collecting coins and items trying to get the highest score possible before crashing.\n\nThe game includes several modes, including a standard mode where the speed limit increases after each wave, a \"hardcore\" mode with even higher difficulty, and even a practice mode. In the multiplayer mode, crashed players can be revived by those who are still alive.",
